      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 70‑mile peninsula that Southern Gateway fronts is the longest stretch of natural coastline left on the East Coast.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://visitesva.com/things-to-do/listings/southern-gateway-welcome-center/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "From bayside to seaside, Southern Gateway offers hidden islands, fresh seafood straight from the tides, and charming bed‑and‑breakfasts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://visitesva.com/things-to-do/listings/southern-gateway-welcome-center/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Southern Gateway’s economy is built on a network of warehouses and distribution centers, making it a key commercial hub for the Mid‑Atlantic.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
